      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira gatatu umwami Belushaza ari ku ngoma, jewe Daniyeli mbona ivyo neretswe bikurikira ivya mbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 1:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona ivyo neretswe nko mu nzozi, maze mvyitegereje mbona ndi ku murwa i Shushani, mu ntāra yo muri Elamu; ndāvye ivyo neretswe mbona ndi ku ruzi Ulayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.8.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 8:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunamuye amaso mbona impfizi y’intama ifise amahembe abiri, ihagaze hakuno y’uruzi: kand’ ayo mahembe ukw ar’ abiri yari maremare, ariko rimwe ryasumba irindi, kand’ irirerire ni ryo ryaheruka kumera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona iyo mpfizi y’intama igenda itwariranya, yerekeye i burengerazuba n’i burārūko n’i bumanuko; ntihāgira igikōko gihangara kuyihagarara imbere, ntihāboneka ūshobora kugira ico ayikiza; ariko yakora uko yigombeye, ikīgira agahambaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.8.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 8:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkivyitegereza, mbona haje impfizi y’impene ivuye i burengerazuba, ica mw isi yose, igenda idakoza amaguru hasi; kand’ iyo mpene yar’ ifise ihembe ry’ akarangabgami hagati y’amaso yayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.8.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 8:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iza kuri ya mpfizi y’intama y’amahembe abiri, nari nabonye ihagaze ku ruzi, irayivumbukira iri n’inkomezi zitewe n’inzigo nyinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona yēgereye iyo mpfizi y’intama, irayishamira, irayisekura, iyivuna ayo mahembe yompi; kand’ iyo mpfizi y’intama ntiyagira inkomezi zo kuyihagarara imbere, arikw iyo mpene iyikubita hasi, irayisiribanga; kand’ iyo mpfizi y’intama ntihāboneka ūshobora kuyikiza ya mpfizi y’impene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.8.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 8:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.8.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ iyo mpfizi y’impene yīgira agahambaye bihebuje; imaze kugira ubushobozi, iryo hembe rihambaye rirakondoka; maze mu kibanza caryo hamera ayandi mahembe ane y’akarangabgami, yerekeye ibirēre bine vy’ijuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 20:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri rimwe mur’ ayo, hashamika agahembe gatoya, karakura, kaba rinini cane, ryerekera i bumanuko n’i burasirazuba no mu gihugu c’ubgiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.14.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 14:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 12:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rihinduka rinini ryagamba no mu ngabo zo mw ijuru, mber’ ingabo zimwe n’inyenyeri zimwe ribishiburira hasi, rirabisiribanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 11:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ryīgira agahambaye, mbere ryiringaniza n’umugabisha w’izo ngabo, rimunyaga ikimazi co kwoswa gihora gitangwa uko bukeye, inyubako z’ahēra hiwe zirasangangurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izo ngabo bo n’ico kimazi gihora gitangwa, bigaburwa mu maboko yaryo kubg’ igicumuro. Ivy’ ukuri ribishiburira hasi, maze rikora ivyo ryigombeye, riratunganirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.4.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 4:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.24+DAN.9.25+DAN.9.26+DAN.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:24-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze numva uwera avuga; kand’ uwundi mu bera abaza umwe yabanje kuvuga, ati Bizogeza ryari ivyerekanywe vy’ikimazi cahora gitangwa, n’ivy’ igicumuro kizanye ubugesera, gitumye ahantu hēra n’ingabo bitangwa bigasiribangwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aranyishura, ati Buzokwira buce imisi ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana atatu; ni ho ahantu hēra hazobona guhumanuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
