        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko yēgēra aho nari mpagaze; anshikiriye ncika ivutu, nikubita hasi nubamye; maz’ arambarira, at’ Umve, yewe mwana w’umuntu, ivyo weretswe n’ivy’ igihe c’iherezo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
