              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akenge kiwe kazotuma ivy’ ubugunge birorana; azokwīgira agahambaye mu mutima wiwe, ageseze benshi ata co binona; mber’ azohaguruka kurwanya Umwami w’abami; arikw azovunagurika, ata wumukozeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
