            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ivyerekanywe vy’ubgira bugaca vy’iyo misi vyavuzwe, n’ivy’ ukuri; arik’ ugumize ivyo weretswe muri ntibate, kukw ar’ ibizoba hahise igihe kirekire. ",
          "type": "text",
