            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze jewe Daniyeli nca ncika intege, mmara imisi ndwaye. Hanyuma mva hasi, nkora ibikorwa vy’umwami; ntangazwa n’ivyo neretswe, kandi nta wobitahura.",
          "type": "text",
